* `index` {integer}
The index operator `[index]` can be used to get and set the octet at position
`index` in `buf`. The values refer to individual bytes, so the legal value
range is between `0x00` and `0xFF` (hex) or `0` and `255` (decimal). This operator is inherited from `Uint8Array`, so its behavior on out-of-bounds
