Section path: UDP/datagram sockets > Class: `dgram.Socket` > `socket.setMulticastInterface(multicastInterface)` > Example: IPv4 outgoing multicast interface

All systems use an IP of the host on the desired physical interface:
```js
const socket = dgram.createSocket('udp4');
socket.bind(1234, () => {
socket.setMulticastInterface('10.0.0.2');
});
