[`fs.createWriteStream()`][] or [`filehandle.createWriteStream()`][]. It is possible to use an {AbortSignal} to cancel an `fsPromises.writeFile()`. Cancelation is "best effort", and some amount of data is likely still
to be written. ```mjs
