Returns an object describing the memory usage of the Node.js process measured in
bytes. ```mjs
import { memoryUsage } from 'node:process';
console.log(memoryUsage());
// Prints:
// {
//  rss: 4935680,
//  heapTotal: 1826816,
//  heapUsed: 650472,
//  external: 49879,
//  arrayBuffers: 9386
